Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:27:21 +0800
Subject: drm/histb: vdp2: scale the plane with the GP0 coefficients

Plane scaling ignored the GP0 coefficient set the scaler expects.
Program the scaling coefficients so the fetched window lands correctly.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 2 files changed, 409 insertions(+), 53 deletions(-)


